This directory contains graphic files for Scoop.

Card faces (`card-S-A.png` … `card-C-K.png`):
  Based on the public-domain French/English-pattern SVG deck
  (vector-playing-cards / SVG-cards lineage). Outer card stroke
  removed so faces are borderless and CSS padding works cleanly.
  Court cards keep their traditional inner illustration frame.

Card back (`card_back.png`):
  Simple original blue back (solid field, double border, center diamond).
  Free to use with this project.

Other assets:
  - card_face.png — unused blank plate (kept for now)
  - table_felt.png, scoop_badge.png — table chrome

Notes:
  - Prefer jpg/png; keep files reasonably small for the web
  - Do not rely on subdirectories under img/ for Studio deploys
